rtunity to kill  him immediately nick and some other  police officers arrive at the house and  arrest her however the arrest is a ruse  because the police officers are actually  undercover mayday resistance who help  kate escape in the next scene nick and  kate have an emotional farewell because  nick has to return to join the mayday  resistance he tells kate that he'll keep  sending her messages and she should run  away and take care of their child until  he returns the episode ends with kate  hiding safely in the mountains thinking  about her first daughter jill while also  awaiting nick's baby's arrival subscribe  for more videos like this turn on  notifications and leave a like to help  the channel out thank you for watching

